Avanti PinPoint Demo Release for Borland CDROM
==============================================

PinPoint is designed to show you your programs' call stack as it is
executing in real time.  It does this by preprocessing your source code
with the MS-DOS program 'ppAutoC', which adds the necessary calls to 
your application's functions.  Then compile (with pp_api.h), link
(with pp_dll.lib), and execute your application after launching PinPoint.

The OWL example TTT (TicTacToe) is provided as an example program.

More detailed documentation is provided in PinPoint.doc, a Word file.

